_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-ssn1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=104&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gGDudEHF0yIEp6lO9j5e-FS4-NTeBWnhz4wGuBvyFCMWnipAuQwp1dJZT4UbqejXKA&_nc_ohc=x0dhgTRFX3QQ7kNvwHpepO3&_nc_gid=-3dFt2VRJhjo0TnZEfMA5Q&edm=ADp7STQBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AQGUNAofw64l8whfbiV8xB6zWWGYnxgJ4tMB0E_XkhWGBQ&oe=6A7506D9&_nc_sid=c6f216", "videoUrl": "https://scontent-ssn1-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQOlAvy4PYzK7W2_xj_TofJaEjea5ZYQEbLsCNFiisTaHW0zA_fdMqd4wqIKzw3rsEE1RNj83cPKJJoZ6C4AvU3Fj3-2k2NWVzvnxEE.mp4?_nc_cat=100&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-ssn1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=B7btOKQO3pAQ7kNvwFZwaP8&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MTQ3MzM5ODI1NDU0OTU2NywiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjksInZpX3VzZWNhc2VfaWQiOjEwMDk5LCJkdXJhdGlvbl9zIjo0NiwidXJsZ2VuX3NvdXJjZSI6Ind3dyJ9&ccb=17-1&vs=667bf0fd44b40c2d&_nc_-6Jm5iIOeBRUCKAJDMywXQEd3bItDlYEYEmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MREAdf4HZeadAQA&_nc_gid=-3dFt2VRJhjo0TnZEfMA5Q&_nc_zt=28&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQENjasvRXz2hsVyyNOvZZa1hLvEzZqMIYW0DzsAt3f2Aw&oe=6A711F05", "ownerUsername": "organizingspacesbykim", "ownerFullName": "Kim | Organizing Spaces by Kim", "history": [{"date": "2026-07-26", "plays": 94417, "likes": 1873, "comments": 711}, {"date": "2026-08-02", "plays": 115916, "likes": 2349, "comments": 975}], "still_climbing": false, "transcript": "Luxury garage organization with a blank slate. My client had all her seasonal decor stored in bins in a separate garage. So step number one was moving every single container to her storage building on the property. We relocated all the bins and opened every one of them and started sorting. As we worked through the contents, Adam, our handyman, was assembling nine shelving units so we could build a system from the ground up. We grouped like items together, making decisions and creating intentional categories. As we went, we added temporary labels with our blue tape to each bin so we knew exactly what was inside before making our permanent polished labels. Creating labels on site allows everything to be fully customizable for each space. Using our portable label maker, we design and print directly from our phone. And here's the final result. Nine shelving units, around 144 containers, all beautifully organized and filled with holiday decor. Now everything is contained, categorized, and ready for next season. And from chaos to calm, one bin at a time.", "is_relevant": true, "hook_type": "Case Study", "videoViewCount": 5553, "musicInfo": {"artist_name": "organizingspacesbykim", "song_name": "Original audio", "uses_original_audio": true, "should_mute_audio": false, "should_mute_audio_reason": "", "audio_id": "27854355690850426"}}, {"shortCode": "DbHJnapKusd", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DbHJnapKusd/", "caption": "My husband complains about my attitude and that I don\u2019t listen. Sir\u2026 you\u2019ve had custody of me since I was 19. I\u2019m almost 42 with three of your kids. This is a management issue! \ud83d\ude02 \n\n#husbandandwife #husbandandwifehumor #husbandhumor", "timestamp": "2026-07-22T22:22:01.000Z", "videoDuration": 8.869, "videoPlayCount": 23549, "videoViewCount": 652, "likesCount": 179, "commentsCount": 27, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-cdg4-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/753429066_18219859747336816_3337873973715382029_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-cdg4-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=104&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gHaZHnbFRku3VdvOIYwuu35vqkhRFUnmtPer2khjfxiWk8Pp-WUbkVjxO8ViXW7yGI&_nc_ohc=eQrum61YWTsQ7kNvwELKxui&_nc_gid=eSE9xlAK-6IZql5mTGlVOg&edm=ADp7STQBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AQHrM0me6y57e8nrxGX7c4yhb5XnFcYBm7fb57gYU37Hbg&oe=6A75048C&_nc_sid=c6f216", "videoUrl": "https://scontent-cdg4-2.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQN87lC-x4hbPGFCMxAfqxfuET9uu8WW3RlOUIOofLU5h90FVrYwK-bdk2FObRffq_Rf9KGulLqj8SBwiPxWw29y6Xv0syvJx11Etnw.mp4?_nc_cat=101&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-cdg4-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=yec-Cy3o7QMQ7kNvwEpUSGc&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJU