aces by Kim", "transcript": "What do professional organizers do all day? Moving edition. Every project starts with a consultation where I take measurements and learn the client's style. So like today, I know exactly what product to bring on install day. This is how we typically start our day, boxes everywhere. As we unpack, we sort, group like items and declutter, leaving every item with a purpose and a place. Once we realized how much you dread moving, we decided to step in and handle it all so you can simply enjoy your new home. What might take weeks or months for you to do on your own, we can complete in just a few days. Our proven process has been refined through countless concierge moves. Our custom labels aren't just beautiful, but they are functional. By the end of the day, we've replaced the chaos of moving with a beautifully organized home that's ready to enjoy.", "history": [{"date": "2026-07-18", "plays": 5939, "likes": 58, "comments": 10}, {"date": "2026-07-19", "plays": 5965, "likes": 58, "comments": 10}, {"date": "2026-07-26", "plays": 7322, "likes": 78, "comments": 25}, {"date": "2026-08-02", "plays": 7712, "likes": 90, "comments": 27}], "still_climbing": false, "hook_type": "Education", "is_relevant": true}]}